      "content": "thanks. it's a good start, but the completeness metric is coming back a bit low for our documentation standards. i know i said not to pad it, but it feels a little thin for a formal guide.\n\ncan you expand this out a bit more? maybe add some context around what each step actually does under the hood, or some extra technical details about the environment requirements so it's more thorough. just try to make it feel like a substantial, professional guide without being annoying.",
